1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,730
Every idea begins with a few words.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,335
Ariane gives them room to grow.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,870
Keep your sources close,
without leaving the page.

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:11,050
Write in live Markdown.

5
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,265
Shape your thoughts.

6
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,430
Nest.

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,755
Move.

8
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:16,835
Unfold.

9
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:20,685
Focus on a paragraph. Or a single sentence.

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,205
Capture a thought with local dictation.

11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,315
Find the thread across
your writing and notes.

12
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,580
Every word counts.

13
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,325
Make time for twenty-five minutes of focus.

14
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:36,205
Revisit a draft.

15
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,555
Keep what matters.

16
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:46,950
Ariane. Your words. In context.
